# Auto-enter the flake devShell on cd (needs `direnv allow` once).
#
# nix-direnv prints a large `export +VAR…` env diff and the devShell banner on
# each cache rebuild (flake.nix / .envrc change) — that's nix's build env, not an
# error. To hide the diff globally: `~/.config/direnv/direnv.toml` → [global]
# hide_env_diff = true (direnv ≥ 2.33).
use flake
